Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:17:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] ASoC: SM-T545 sound: msm8916 wcd codec changes and
 sdm845 machine driver

Internal microphone and speaker paths: two CS35L41 amplifiers on the secondary MI2S, LPI pins written after the bit clock runs, analog/digital codec changes for the PM660L.
---
