+	 * shortcut: SM-T545 board mic wiring (vendor micbias_put, CONFIG_SEC_GTACTIVEXL_PROJECT): TX1N/TX2N off the
+	 * micbias pull-up (bits 6/3 cleared, 5/2 set from POR 0x49) and the TX3 ground select; move to DT for a second board
+	 */
